        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakabika impi mucisi ca-Edomu. Mucisi coonse buyo ca-Edomu wakabika impi, aboobo baEdomu boonse bakaba bazike ba-Davida. Nkabela Jehova wakazundya Davida koonse koonse nkwaakaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
